<title>UK: Bank Austria sets 500 mln ATS 10yr structured bond.</title>
<headline>Bank Austria sets 500 mln ATS 10yr structured bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was self-led by Bank Austria.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANK AUSTRIA</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN ATS   COUPON    *7.0 PCT   MATURITY    26.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE   FIXED REV FRN ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    26.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES	*FOR THE FIRST FIVE YEARS, THEN 15.50 PCT LESS TWO</p>
<p>		TIMES 12-MONTH-VIBOR ON A BOND BASIS</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    VIENNA</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (M) ONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
